            <ArticleTitle>Clinton's 'Medicare for More' Not Such an Easy Cure.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>11-12</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The politics of &quot;Medicare for more&quot; are daunting. Not only will Clinton have to defeat Donald Trump in November, she will need to pull enough Democrats into the House and Senate with her-and they will have to be the kind of Democrats who are willing to take on the political risks of health care reform.</AbstractText>
